/** Batch 15 part F — rest indices 220–274 */
export function applyB15PartF(r) {
  const rows = [
    ["This account is registered as a provider. Tap below to jump into the Beautonomi Partner app, or continue on the web customer portal to book services.", "Hierdie rekening is as 'n verskaffer geregistreer. Tik hieronder om na die Beautonomi Partner-app te spring, of gaan voort op die web kliëntportaal om dienste te bespreek.", "Le akhawunti ibhaliswe njengomhlinzeki. Thepha ngezansi ukuze ungene ku-Beautonomi Partner app, noma uqhubeke ku-web customer portal ukubhuka.", "Akhaonte ena e ngolisitsoe e le mofani. Tlanya ka tlase ho kena app ea Beautonomi Partner, kapa tsoela pele portal ea bareki web ho beha litšebeletso.", "Akhawunti leyi yi tsarisiwile tanihi mu nyiki. Tlika laha hansi u nghena eka Beautonomi Partner app, kumbe ya emahlweni eka web customer portal ku endla odara."],
    ["Metrics show pending bookings that may include group requests or another date range. Pull to refresh, or open Group bookings to review party requests.", "Metrieke wys hangende besprekings wat groepversoeke of 'n ander datumreeks kan insluit. Trek om te verfris, of maak Groepbesprekings oop om partyversoeke te hersien.", "Amamethrikhi ebonisa ukubhuka okulindile okungase kuhlanganise nezicelo zeqembu noma ibanga ledethi elihlukile. Donsela ukuvuselela, noma vula i-Group bookings ukuze uhlole izicelo.", "Metriki e bontša litheho tse emetseng tse ka kenyang likopo tsa sehlopha kapa nako e 'ngoe. Hula ho nchafatsa, kapa bula Group bookings ho hlahloba likopo.", "Metriki yi kombisa tibhuku leti yimile leti nga katsa swikombelo swa ntlawa kumbe nkarhi wun'wana. Draha ku pfuxeta, kumbe pfula Group bookings ku kambela swikombelo."],
    ["Add your bank account so finance can pay platform-held earnings to the right account. You can verify with Paystack or enter the account name manually.", "Voeg jou bankrekening by sodat finansies platform-verdienste na die regte rekening kan betaal. Jy kan met Paystack verifieer of die rekeningnaam handmatig invoer.", "Engeza i-akhawunti yakho yasebhange ukuze imali ikhokhele imali ephathwe ipulatifomu ku-akhawunti efanele. Ungaqinisekisa nge-Paystack noma ufake igama le-akhawunti ngesandla.", "Kenya akhaonte ea hau ea banka hore chelete e lefe chelete e tshoaritsoeng sethaleng akhaonteng e nepahetseng. O ka netefatsa ka Paystack kapa o kenye lebitso la akhaonte ka letsoho.", "Engetela akhawunti ya wena ya bangi leswaku mali yi hakere mali leyi tshuriweke hi platfomu eka akhawunti leyinene. U nga tiyisisa hi Paystack kumbe u nghenisa vito ra akhawunti hi ku tala."],
    ["Some team members were deactivated after a plan downgrade. Grace lasts until {{date}}. Upgrade or keep the roster at the new limit to reactivate them.", "Sommige spanlede is gedeaktiveer na 'n plan-afgradering. Genade duur tot {{date}}. Gradeer op of hou die roster by die nuwe limiet om hulle te heraktiveer.", "Abanye amalungu eqembu akhutshazwe ngemva kokwehla kweplani. Isikhathi sokubekezelela sihlala kuze kube ngu-{{date}}. Thuthukisa noma ugcine uhlu olusha ukuze ubavuselele.", "Basebetsi ba bang ba timilwe ka mor'a ho theoha ha moralo. Nako ea ho tshwarela e lula ho fihlela {{date}}. Atolosa kapa boloka lenaneo lefihleleng le lecha ho ba bulela hape.", "Vamukanyi van'wana va timisiwile endzhaku ka ku tlakuka ka xileriso. Nkarhi wa ku rivalela wu tshama ku fikela {{date}}. Antswisa kumbe tshama na nxaxamelo eka xikomo lexintshwa u va pfuxeta."],
    ["You must be at least 13 to use social features such as Explore, comments, likes, and messaging. Age is verified using your date of birth after sign-in.", "Jy moet ten minste 13 wees om sosiale funksies soos Explore, opmerkings, likes en boodskappe te gebruik. Ouderdom word met jou geboortedatum na aanmelding geverifieer.", "Kufanele ube neminyaka engu-13 noma ngaphezulu ukuze usebenzise izici zokuxhumana ezinjenge-Explore, amazwi, ukuthandwa, nemilayezo. Iminyaka iqinisekiswa ngosuku lwakho lokuzalwa ngemva kokungena.", "U tlameha ho ba le lilemo tse ka holimo ho 13 ho sebelisa likarolo tsa sechaba joalo ka Explore, maikutlo, ho rate, le melaetsa. Lilemo li netefatsoa ka letsatsi la hau la tsoalo ka mor'a ho kena.", "U fanele u va na malembe ya 13 ku tirhisa swifunghwa swa vanhu swo fana na Explore, mavonelo, ku rhandza, na mahungu. Malembe ya tiyisisiwa hi siku ra wena ro velekiwa endzhaku ka ku nghena."],
    ["Cancel this booking now?\n\nEstimated cancellation fee: {{currency}} {{fee}}\nEstimated wallet refund: {{currency}} {{refund}}{{capBlock}}\n\n{{windowLine}}", "Kanselleer hierdie bespreking nou?\n\nGeskatte kansellasiefooi: {{currency}} {{fee}}\nGeskatte beursie-terugbetaling: {{currency}} {{refund}}{{capBlock}}\n\n{{windowLine}}", "Khansela lokhu kubhuka manje?\n\nImali yokukhansela elinganisiwe: {{currency}} {{fee}}\nImbuyiselo yesikhwama elinganisiwe: {{currency}} {{refund}}{{capBlock}}\n\n{{windowLine}}", "Hlakola odara ena hona joale?\n\nTefo e lebelloang ea ho hlakola: {{currency}} {{fee}}\nHo busetsa sepache ho lebelloa: {{currency}} {{refund}}{{capBlock}}\n\n{{windowLine}}", "Khansela odara leyi sweswi?\n\nMali ya ku khansela leyi ringanyisiweke: {{currency}} {{fee}}\nKu vuyiswa ka xipache lexi ringanyisiweke: {{currency}} {{refund}}{{capBlock}}\n\n{{windowLine}}"],
    ["Turn on notifications so you never miss bookings, messages, and payout updates. Location and photo access are requested later when you use those features.", "Skakel kennisgewings aan sodat jy nooit besprekings, boodskappe en uitbetaling-opdaterings mis nie. Ligging- en fototoegang word later gevra wanneer jy daardie funksies gebruik.", "Vula izaziso ukuze ungaphuthelwa ukubhuka, imilayezo, nezibuyekezo zokukhokhelwa. Ukufinyelela indawo nezithombe kucelwa kamuva lapho usebenzisa lezo zici.", "Bula litsebiso hore u se ke wa fetwa ke litheho, melaetsa, le lintlafatso tsa ho lefa. Ho fihlella sebaka le litšoantšo ho kopoa hamorao ha o sebelisa likarolo tseo.", "Pfulela swiviso leswaku u nga tluli hi tibhuku, mahungu, na swivuselelo swa ku hakerisa. Ku fikelela ndhawu na swifaniso swi kombetiwaka endzhaku loko u tirhisa swifunghwa leswi."],
    ["Add this code to your website to embed the booking widget. Card payment and Google or Apple sign-in open on Beautonomi so the customer can finish securely.", "Voeg hierdie kode by jou webwerf om die besprekingswidget in te bed. Kaartbetaling en Google- of Apple-aanmelding open op Beautonomi sodat die kliënt veilig kan voltooi.", "Engeza le khodi kuwebhusayithi yakho ukuze ufake i-widget yokubhuka. Inkokhelo yekhadi nokungena nge-Google noma i-Apple kuvula ku-Beautonomi ukuze ikhasimende liqede ngokuphepha.", "Kenya khoutu ena webosaeteng ea hau ho kenya widget ea ho theha. Tefo ea karete le ho kena ka Google kapa Apple li bula Beautonomi hore moreki a qetelle ka tsela e sireletsehileng.", "Engetela khoutu leyi eka web sayiti ya wena ku nghenisa widget ya ku endla odara. Ku hakela ka khadi na ku nghena hi Google kumbe Apple swi pfula eka Beautonomi leswaku xixaxani xi hetisa hi ndlela leyi sirhelelekeke."],
    ["This build is missing a required setting (EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL). Please reinstall the latest app from the store, or contact support if the problem persists.", "Hierdie bou ontbreek 'n vereiste instelling (EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL). Herinstalleer asseblief die nuutste app uit die winkel, of kontak ondersteuning as die probleem voortduur.", "Lokhu kuhlelwa akunaso isethingi esidingekayo (EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL). Sicela ufake kabusha uhlelo lwakho olusha kusuka esitolo, noma uxhumane nokusekelwa uma inkinga iqhubeka.", "Moaho ona o hloka litlhophiso tse hlokahalang (EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL). Ka kopo kenya hape app ea morao-rao lebenkeleng, kapa ikopanye le tšehetso haeba bothata bo tsoela pele.", "Ku aka leku swi nga ri na xiyimiso lexi lavekaka (EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL). Hi kombela u veka nakambe app ya sweswinyana ku suka eka vhengele, kumbe tihlanganisa na nseketelo loko xiphiqo xi ya emahlweni."],
    ["Apple manages this subscription. Cancel at least 24 hours before the period ends in Apple ID → Subscriptions. You keep access until the current period ends.", "Apple bestuur hierdie intekening. Kanselleer ten minste 24 uur voor die periode eindig in Apple ID → Subscriptions. Jy behou toegang tot die huidige periode eindig.", "I-Apple iphatha lesi sipho. Khansela okungenani amahora angu-24 ngaphambi kokuphela kwesikhathi ku-Apple ID → Subscriptions. Ugcina ukufinyelela kuze kube yilapho isikhathi samanje siphela.", "Apple e laola peeletso ena. Hlakola bonyane lihora tse 24 pele nako e qetella Apple ID → Subscriptions. O lula o na ho fihlella ho fihlela nako ea hajoale e qetella.", "Apple yi lawula xivumelwano lexi. Khansela u nga ri hafu tiawara ta 24 u sa athu nkarhi wu hele Apple ID → Subscriptions. U tshama u na mfikelelo ku fikela nkarhi wa sweswi wu hele."],
    ["This will delete the entire recurring series for {{name}}. Future auto-created visits will stop; existing bookings already on the calendar stay as they are.", "Dit sal die hele herhalende reeks vir {{name}} verwyder. Toekomstige outo-geskepte besoeke sal stop; bestaande besprekings op die kalender bly soos hulle is.", "Lokhu kuzosusa uchungechunge oluphindayo oluphelele lwe-{{name}}. Ukuvakasha okuzokwakhiwa ngokuzenzakalelayo kuzoma; ukubhuka okukhona okusesikalendeni kuhlala njengokungokwakho.", "Sena se tla hlakola letoto leohle le phetaang bakeng sa {{name}}. Liketelo tse tla thehoa ka boiketsetso li tla ema; litheho tse seng li le khalendareng li lula joalo ka ha li le.", "Lexi xi ta susa ndyangu hinkwawo lowu phindzaka wa {{name}}. Tinyiko leti ta tumbuluxiwa hi ku tisungulela ti ta yima; tibhuku leti nga kona eka kalenda ti tshama tanihi leswi swi nga ri kona."],
    ["Ask the customer to scan this QR or use the link to pay. Paystack generates the transaction reference; once it arrives, allocate it from your terminal inbox.", "Vra die kliënt om hierdie QR te skandeer of die skakel te gebruik om te betaal. Paystack genereer die transaksiereferensie; sodra dit arriveer, ken dit toe vanaf jou terminal-inboks.", "Cela ikhasimende liskene le QR noma lisebenzise isixhumanisi sokukhokha. I-Paystack ikhiqiza isibalo sokuthengiselana; uma sefika, yabela kusuka ku-terminal inbox yakho.", "Kopa moreki a skene QR ena kapa a sebelise sehokelo ho lefa. Paystack e hlahisa reference ea phetiso; ha e fihla, aba ka tsoa inbox ea terminal ea hau.", "Kombela xixaxani a skene QR leyi kumbe a tirhisa xixaka ku hakela. Paystack yi tumbuluxa nomboro ya ntirhisano; loko yi fika, yisa ku suka eka inbox ya terminal ya wena."],
    ["Automated business verification is not available for your registration country. Contact support with your company registration documents for a manual review.", "Outomatiese besigheidsverifikasie is nie beskikbaar vir jou registrasieland nie. Kontak ondersteuning met jou maatskappyregistrasiedokumente vir 'n handmatige hersiening.", "Ukuqinisekisa kwebhizinisi okuzenzakalelayo akutholakali ezweni lakho lokubhalisa. Xhumana nokusekelwa nemibhalo yakho yokubhaliswa kwenkampani ukuze ihlolwe ngesandla.", "Netefatso ea k'hamphani ea boiketsetso ha e fumanehe naheng ea hau ea ngoliso. Ikopanye le tšehetso ka litokomane tsa ngoliso ea k'hamphani bakeng sa tlhahlobo ea letsoho.", "Ku tiyisisa bindzuri hi ku tisungulela a ku kumeki eka tiko ra wena leri u tsarisiweke kona. Tihlanganisa na nseketelo na switokoxana swa wena swa ku tsarisa khamphani ku kambetwa hi ku tala."],
    ["Beautonomi uses your date of birth to apply age-appropriate features, parental controls, and verification requirements. Your current age band is shown below.", "Beautonomi gebruik jou geboortedatum om ouderdomstoepaslike funksies, ouerlike kontroles en verifikasievereistes toe te pas. Jou huidige ouderdomsgroep word hieronder gewys.", "I-Beautonomi isebenzisa usuku lwakho lokuzalwa ukufaka izici ezifanele iminyaka, ukulawula kwabazali, nezidingo zokuqinisekisa. Ibanga lakho lobudala lamanje liboniswa ngezansi.", "Beautonomi e sebelisa letsatsi la hau la tsoalo ho sebelisa likarolo tse loketseng lilemo, taolo ea batswadi, le litlhoko tsa netefatso. Sehlopha sa hau sa lilemo sa hajoale se bontšoa ka tlase.", "Beautonomi yi tirhisa siku ra wena ro velekiwa ku tirhisa swifunghwa leswi fanaka na malembe, vulawuri bya vatswadi, na swilaveko swa ku tiyisisa. Xiyenge xa wena xa malembe xa sweswi xi kombisiwa laha hansi."],
    ["After setup, you can complete full identity verification (ID document) to earn the Verified marketplace badge. This is optional but increases customer trust.", "Na opstelling kan jy volledige identiteitsverifikasie (ID-dokument) voltooi om die Verified-markplek-kenteken te verdien. Dit is opsioneel maar verhoog kliëntvertroue.", "Ngemva kokusetha, ungaqedela ukuqinisekisa ubuwena obuphelele (idokhumenti ye-ID) ukuze uthole ibheji ye-Verified. Lokhu kuyinketho kodwa kukhulisa ukuthembeka kwamakhasimende.", "Ka mor'a ho hlophisa, o ka qetella netefatso e felletseng ea boitsebiso (tokomane ea ID) ho fumana baeche Verified. Sena ke khetho empa se matlafatsa tšepo ea bareki.", "Endzhaku ka ku vekiwa, u nga hetisa ku tiyisisa vutivi hi ku helela (xitokoxana xa ID) ku kuma baeche ya Verified. Lexi i nkhetho kambe xi tlakusa ku tshemba ka vaxavi."],
    ["Save into your phone’s calendar app (Apple Calendar, Google on your device, Samsung Calendar, etc.), open a web calendar, or share a file to import anywhere.", "Stoor in jou foon se kalender-app (Apple Calendar, Google op jou toestel, Samsung Calendar, ens.), maak 'n webkalender oop, of deel 'n lêer om enige plek in te voer.", "Yigcine ku-app yekhalenda yefoni yakho (Apple Calendar, Google kudivayisi yakho, Samsung Calendar, njll.), vula ikhalenda ye-web, noma yabelana ngefayela ukuze ulinge noma kuphi.", "Boloka app ea khalendara ea fono ea hau (Apple Calendar, Google sesebelisoa sa hau, Samsung Calendar, jj.), bula khalendara ea web, kapa arolelana faele ho kenya hohle.", "Hlayisa eka app ya kalenda ya riqingho ra wena (Apple Calendar, Google eka xitirhisiwa xa wena, Samsung Calendar, na sw.), pfula kalenda ya web, kumbe avelana faele ku nghenisa laha u nga ri kona."],
    ["Password accounts confirm with your current password. Accounts that sign in with email or phone codes will be asked for a one-time verification code instead.", "Wagwoordrekeninge bevestig met jou huidige wagwoord. Rekeninge wat met e-pos of foonkodes aanmeld, sal eerder 'n eenmalige verifikasiekode gevra word.", "Ama-akhawunti ephasiwedi aqinisekisa ngephasiwedi yakho yamanje. Ama-akhawunti angena nge-imeyili noma amakhodi efoni azocelwa ikhodi yokuqinisekisa yesikhathi esisodwa.", "Liakhaonte tsa password li netefatsa ka password ea hau ea hajoale. Liakhaonte tse kentseng ka imeile kapa likhoutu tsa fono li tla kopoa khoutu ea netefatso ea nako e le 'ngoe.", "Tiakhawunti ta password ti tiyisisa hi password ya wena ya sweswi. Tiakhawunti leti nghenaka hi imeyili kumbe tikhoutu ta riqingho ti ta kombetwa khoutu yo tiyisisa ya nkarhi wun'we."],
    ["You are only charged after you confirm with Face ID, Touch ID, or your App Store password. Your plan activates once Apple verifies the purchase — never before.", "Jy word eers gehef nadat jy met Face ID, Touch ID of jou App Store-wagwoord bevestig. Jou plan aktiveer sodra Apple die aankoop verifieer — nooit voor nie.", "Ukhokhiswa kuphela ngemva kokuqinisekisa nge-Face ID, Touch ID, noma iphasiwedi ye-App Store. Uhlelo lwakho luyasebenza uma i-Apple iqinisekise ukuthenga — akukho ngaphambili.", "U lefisoa feela ka mor'a hore u netefatsa ka Face ID, Touch ID, kapa password ea hau ea App Store. Moralo oa hau o qala ha Apple e netefatsa theko — ha ho pele.", "U hakeriwa ntsena endzhaku ka ku tiyisisa hi Face ID, Touch ID, kumbe password ya wena ya App Store. Xileriso xa wena xi sungula loko Apple yi tiyisisa ku xava — a ku na ku endla emahlweni."],
    ["Weekly schedules define normal availability. Date-specific shifts below support split shifts and one-off overrides for busy days, events, or alternate rosters.", "Weeklikse skedules definieer normale beskikbaarheid. Datumspesifieke skofte hieronder ondersteun verdeelde skofte en eenmalige oorrides vir besige dae, gebeure of alternatiewe rosters.", "Amasheduli eviki achaza ukutholakala okujwayelekile. Ama-shift anezinsuku ngezansi asekela ukuhlukaniswa kwama-shift nokushintsha okukodwa ngezinsuku ezimatasa, imicimbi, noma ama-roster.", "Mananeo a beke a hlalosa ho fumaneha ha tloaelehileng. Li-shift tsa letsatsi ka tlase li tšehetsa ho arohana ha li-shift le ho fetola hang bakeng sa matsatsi a matla, liketsahalo, kapa li-roster.", "Swileriso swa vhiki swi hlamusela ku kumeka loku tolovelekeke. Tshift leti nga na masiku laha hansi ti seketela ku avanyisiwa ka tshift na ku tlula ka nkarhi wun'we masiku yo tala, swiendlakalo, kumbe ti-roster."],
    ["Earnings appear here once payments are recorded in your finance ledger (online and platform-held payments). Cash collected directly may not show in this total.", "Verdienste verskyn hier sodra betalings in jou finansiegrootboek aangeteken is (aanlyn en platform-verdienste). Kontant wat direk ingesamel is, mag dalk nie in hierdie totaal wys nie.", "Imiholo ivelela lapha uma izinkokhelo sezibhalwe encwadini yakho yezimali (eziku-inthanethi neziphathwe ipulatifomu). Imali engokoqobo eqoqwe ngokuqondile ingase ingabonakali kulokhu okuphelele.", "Chelete e fumanoeng e hlaha mona ha litefo li ngodisoa bukaneng ea hau ea lichelete (litefo tsa inthaneteng le tse tshoaritsoeng sethaleng). Chelete ea chelete e bokelitsoeng ka kotloloho e ka se bonahale palong ena.", "Mali leyi kumiweke yi humelela laha loko swihakelo swi tsariwile eka buku ya wena ya mali (swa inthanete na leswi tshuriweke hi platfomu). Mali ya kheshi leyi bokiwaka hi ku kongoma yi nga ha yi kombiwi eka nhlayo leyi."],
    ["1) Sign in to Yoco dashboard.\n2) Open API credentials / developer settings.\n3) Copy your live secret key. Add the webhook secret too if you use hosted checkout.", "1) Meld aan by Yoco-dashboard.\n2) Maak API-geloofsbriewe / ontwikkelaarinstellings oop.\n3) Kopieer jou live geheime sleutel. Voeg die webhook-geheim ook by as jy gehoste afhandeling gebruik.", "1) Ngena ku-Yoco dashboard.\n2) Vula ama-API credentials / izilungiselelo zomthuthukisi.\n3) Kopisha isitshixo sakho esiyimfihlo esibukhoma. Engeza ne-webhook secret uma usebenzisa i-hosted checkout.", "1) Kena dashboard ea Yoco.\n2) Bula API credentials / litlhophiso tsa developer.\n3) Kopitsa senotlolo sa hau sa sephiri se phelang. Kenya le webhook secret haeba o sebelisa hosted checkout.", "1) Nghena eka Yoco dashboard.\n2) Pfula API credentials / swiyimiso swa developer.\n3) Kopisa xitshixo xa wena xo hlayisa lexi tirhaka. Engetela na webhook secret loko u tirhisa hosted checkout."],
    ["Days marked \"Inherited\" follow your location operating hours. Customers can still book those days. Add a weekly shift to set custom hours for this staff member.", "Dae gemerk \"Inherited\" volg jou ligging se bedryfsure. Kliënte kan steeds daardie dae bespreek. Voeg 'n weeklikse skof by om pasgemaakte ure vir hierdie personeellid te stel.", "Izinsuku ezimakwe \"Inherited\" zilandela amahora okusebenza endaweni yakho. Amakhasimende asengabhuka lezo zinsuku. Engeza i-shift yeviki ukuze usethe amahora angokwezifiso kulo lungu lomsebenzi.", "Matsatsi a tshoailoeng \"Inherited\" a latela lihora tsa ho sebetsa tsa sebaka sa hau. Bareki ba ntse ba ka beha matsatsi ao. Kenya shift ea beke ho beha lihora tse ikhethileng bakeng sa setsebi sena.", "Masiku lama tshwiweke \"Inherited\" ya landela tiawara ta ntirho ta ndhawu ya wena. Vaxavi va nga ha endla odara masiku lama. Engetela shift ya vhiki ku veka tiawara to endleriweke eka xirho xa vatirhi lexi."],
    ["They have been added and an invite email was sent (Provider app download link included). Open their profile to review shifts, permissions, and resend if needed.", "Hulle is bygevoeg en 'n uitnodigings-e-pos is gestuur (Verskaffer-app aflaaiskakel ingesluit). Maak hul profiel oop om skofte, regte te hersien en weer te stuur indien nodig.", "Bengeziwe futhi i-imeyili yesimemo ithunyelwe (isixhumanisi sokulanda i-Provider app sifakiwe). Vula iphrofayili yabo ukuze uhlole ama-shift, izimvume, bese uthumela futhi uma kudingeka.", "Ba kentsoe 'me imeile ea memo e rometsoe (sehokelo sa ho khoasolla app ea Provider se kenyelle). Bula profil ea bona ho hlahloba li-shift, litumello, le ho romella hape haeba ho hlokahala.", "Va engeteriwa naswona imeyili ya xitimelo yi rhumeriwa (xixaka xo downloda Partner app xi katsiwile). Pfula profayili ya vona ku kambela tshift, mpfumelelo, u rhumela nakambe loko swi laveka."],
    ["You can use Beautonomi with teen safety defaults enabled. Some social features may be restricted, and a parent or guardian can adjust content & safety settings.", "Jy kan Beautonomi gebruik met tienerveiligheid-verstekke aan. Sommige sosiale funksies kan beperk word, en 'n ouer of voog kan inhoud- en veiligheidinstellings aanpas.", "Ungasebenzisa i-Beautonomi nezilungiselelo zokuphepha zezingane ezivuliwe. Ezinye izici zokuxhumana zingase zivinjelwe, futhi umzali noma umgcini angalungisa izilungiselelo zokuqukethwe nokuphepha.", "O ka sebelisa Beautonomi ka litlhophiso tsa polokeho tsa bahlankana tse butsoeng. Likarolo tse ling tsa sechaba li ka thibeloa, 'me motswadi kapa molebedi a ka fetola litlhophiso tsa dikahare le polokeho.", "U nga tirhisa Beautonomi hi swin'wana swa vuhlayiseki bya vana leswi pfulekeke. Swifunghwa swin'wana swa vanhu swi nga yimisiwa, naswona mufumakadzi kumbe mulanguti a nga lulamisa swiyimiso swa leswi nga endzeni na vuhlayiseki."],
    ["Deactivating disables your account. Your data is kept. You can reactivate by signing in again; we will restore access when your deactivation was self-initiated.", "Deaktiveer skakel jou rekening af. Jou data word behou. Jy kan heraktiveer deur weer aan te meld; ons herstel toegang wanneer jou deaktivering self geïnisieer is.", "Ukukhubaza kukhubaza i-akhawunti yakho. Idatha yakho igcinwa. Ungayivuselela ngokungena futhi; sizobuyisela ukufinyelela uma ukukhubaza kwakho kwenziwe nguwe.", "Ho tima ho tima akhaonte ea hau. Data ea hau e bolokoa. O ka e bulela hape ka ho kena hape; re tla khutlisa ho fihlella ha u timile ka boomo.", "Ku tima ku tima akhawunti ya wena. Data ya wena yi hlayisiwa. U nga yi pfuxeta hi ku nghena nakambe; hi ta vuyisela mfikelelo loko ku tima kwakho ku sungurile hi wena."],
    ["Beautonomi Ops has been notified and will create your Paystack Virtual Terminal shortly. Your terminal, payment link, QR, and poster will appear here once ready.", "Beautonomi Ops is in kennis gestel en sal binnekort jou Paystack Virtual Terminal skep. Jou terminal, betalingskakel, QR en plakkaat sal hier verskyn sodra dit gereed is.", "I-Beautonomi Ops isazisiwe futhi izokwakha i-Paystack Virtual Terminal yakho maduze. I-terminal yakho, isixhumanisi sokukhokha, i-QR, nepositha zizovela lapha uma zilungile.", "Beautonomi Ops e tsebisitsoe 'me e tla theha Paystack Virtual Terminal ea hau haufinyane. Terminal ea hau, sehokelo sa tefo, QR, le poseter li tla hlaha mona ha li se li lokile.", "Beautonomi Ops yi tivisiwile naswona yi ta tumbuluxa Paystack Virtual Terminal ya wena ku nga ri khale. Terminal ya wena, xixaka xa xihakelo, QR, na posita yi ta humelela laha loko yi lunghele."],
    ["Ask the customer to pay using this Paystack link. Paystack generates the transaction reference; this sale stays pending until you allocate the webhooked payment.", "Vra die kliënt om met hierdie Paystack-skakel te betaal. Paystack genereer die transaksiereferensie; hierdie verkoop bly hangend totdat jy die webhook-betaling toeken.", "Cela ikhasimende likhokhe usebenzisa lesi sixhumanisi se-Paystack. I-Paystack ikhiqiza isibalo sokuthengiselana; le ntengiso ihlala ilindile kuze uwabe inkokhelo ye-webhook.", "Kopa moreki a lefe a sebelisa sehokelo sena sa Paystack. Paystack e hlahisa reference ea phetiso; thekiso ena e lula e emetse ho fihlela u aba tefo ea webhook.", "Kombela xixaxani a hlawule a tirhisa xixaka xa Paystack lexi. Paystack yi tumbuluxa nomboro ya ntirhisano; ku xavisa leku yi tshama yi yimile ku fikela u yisa xihakelo xa webhook."],
    ["“—” for occupancy means no scheduled availability for that row but bookings exist. Percentages above 100% mean booked service minutes exceed summed shift windows.", "\"—\" vir okupansie beteken geen geskeduleerde beskikbaarheid vir daardie ry nie maar besprekings bestaan. Persentasies bo 100% beteken bespreekte diensminute oorskry som van skofvensters.", "I-\"—\" yokugcwalisa isho ukuthi akukho ukutholakala okuhleliwe kulowo mugqa kodwa kukhona ukubhuka. Amaphesenti ngaphezu kwe-100% asho ukuthi imizuzu yesevisi ebhukiwe idlula ama-shift.", "\"—\" bakeng sa ho tlatsa bo bolela ha ho na ho fumaneha ho hlophisitsoeng mola oo empa ho na litheho. Peresente tse holimo ho 100% bo bolela metsotso ea litšebeletso tse behiloeng e feta lifensetere tsa li-shift.", "\"—\" ya ku tata yi vula a ku na ku kumeka loku hleleriweke eka layini leyi kambe ku na tibhuku. Tiphesente leti tlula 100% ti vula timinete ta nseketelo leti endliweke ti tlula tifasitere ta tshift."],
    ["You are only charged after you confirm with Face ID, Touch ID, or your App Store password. Your campaign goes live once Apple verifies the purchase — never before.", "Jy word eers gehef nadat jy met Face ID, Touch ID of jou App Store-wagwoord bevestig. Jou veldtog gaan live sodra Apple die aankoop verifieer — nooit voor nie.", "Ukhokhiswa kuphela ngemva kokuqinisekisa nge-Face ID, Touch ID, noma iphasiwedi ye-App Store. Ikhampeni yakho iyaqala uma i-Apple iqinisekise ukuthenga — akukho ngaphambili.", "U lefisoa feela ka mor'a hore u netefatsa ka Face ID, Touch ID, kapa password ea hau ea App Store. Letšolo la hau le qala ha Apple e netefatsa theko — ha ho pele.", "U hakeriwa ntsena endzhaku ka ku tiyisisa hi Face ID, Touch ID, kumbe password ya wena ya App Store. Kampeni ya wena yi sungula loko Apple yi tiyisisa ku xava — a ku na ku endla emahlweni."],
    ["This build is missing a required setting (EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL). Please reinstall the latest provider app from the store, or contact support if the problem persists.", "Hierdie bou ontbreek 'n vereiste instelling (EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL). Herinstalleer asseblief die nuutste verskaffer-app uit die winkel, of kontak ondersteuning as die probleem voortduur.", "Lokhu kuhlelwa akunaso isethingi esidingekayo (EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL). Sicela ufake kabusha uhlelo lwakho lwabahlinzeki olusha kusuka esitolo, noma uxhumane nokusekelwa uma inkinga iqhubeka.", "Moaho ona o hloka litlhophiso tse hlokahalang (EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL). Ka kopo kenya hape app ea mofani ea morao-rao lebenkeleng, kapa ikopanye le tšehetso haeba bothata bo tsoela pele.", "Ku aka leku swi nga ri na xiyimiso lexi lavekaka (EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL). Hi kombela u veka nakambe app ya mu nyiki ya sweswinyana ku suka eka vhengele, kumbe tihlanganisa na nseketelo loko xiphiqo xi ya emahlweni."],
    ["Connect third-party services to send email, SMS, and WhatsApp to your clients. Setup runs in your secure Beautonomi dashboard and syncs back to the app automatically.", "Koppel derdeparty-dienste om e-pos, SMS en WhatsApp aan jou kliënte te stuur. Opstelling loop in jou veilige Beautonomi-dashboard en sinkroniseer outomaties terug na die app.", "Xhuma amasevisi angaphandle ukuthumela i-imeyili, i-SMS, ne-WhatsApp amakhasimende akho. Ukusetha kwenziwa ku-dashboard yakho ye-Beautonomi evikelekile futhi kuvumelanisa ngokuzenzakalelayo ku-app.", "Hokela litšebeletso tsa batho ba bang ho romella imeile, SMS, le WhatsApp ho bareki ba hau. Ho hlophisa ho etsahala dashboard ea hau e sireletsehileng ea Beautonomi 'me ho tsamaisana hape ho app.", "Hlanganisa tinsita ta vanhu van'wana ku rhumela imeyili, SMS, na WhatsApp eka vaxavi va wena. Ku vekiwa swi endla eka dashboard ya wena yo sirheleleke ya Beautonomi naswona swi hlanganisa hi ku tisungulela eka app."],
    ["We're reviewing your documents — this can take a few minutes if additional checks are running. You can continue setup; we'll notify you when verification is complete.", "Ons hersien jou dokumente — dit kan 'n paar minute neem as addisionele kontroles loop. Jy kan opstelling voortset; ons sal jou in kennis stel wanneer verifikasie voltooi is.", "Sihlola amadokhumenti akho — lokhu kungathatha imizuzu embalwa uma kunezinye izihlolo. Ungaqhubeka nokusetha; sizokwazisa uma ukuqinisekisa kuqediwe.", "Re hlahloba litokomane tsa hau — sena se ka nka metsotso e 'me haeba ho na le tlhahlobo e eketsehileng. O ka tsoela pele ho hlophisa; re tla u tsebisa ha netefatso e qetile.", "Hi kambela switokoxana swa wena — leswi swi nga teka timinete tin'wana loko ku ri na swikambelo swo engetela. U nga ha ya emahlweni u veka; hi ta ku tivisa loko ku tiyisisa ku heta."],
    ["Reports go to our trust & safety queue. Include who you're reporting and what happened. Urgent danger? Call emergency services first, then use Contact trust & safety.", "Verslae gaan na ons vertroue- en veiligheid-waglys. Sluit in wie jy rapporteer en wat gebeur het. Dringende gevaar? Bel eers nooddienste, gebruik dan Contact trust & safety.", "Imibiko iya ohlwini lwethu lwe-trust & safety. Faka ukuthi ubani obikayo nokwenzekile. Ingozi ephuthumayo? Shaya izinsiza eziphuthumayo kuqala, bese usebenzisa Contact trust & safety.", "Litlaleho li ea moleng oa rona oa trust & safety. Kenya hore na u tlalela mang le seo etsahetseng. Kotsi e potlakileng? Letsetsa litšebeletso tsa tshohilo pele, ebe o sebelisa Contact trust & safety.", "Swiviko swi ya eka layini ya wena ya trust & safety. Katsa u ndi ani leri u ri karhi u vika na leswi humelekeke. Xihloko? Bitani tinsita ta xihatla u sungula, u tlhe u tirhisa Contact trust & safety."],
    ["Staff can work assigned services. Managers can help manage bookings and team workflows depending on permissions. Owner should only be used for trusted business owners.", "Personeel kan toegewysde dienste doen. Bestuurders kan help besprekings en spanwerkstrome bestuur afhangende van regte. Eienaar behoort slegs vir vertroude besigheideienaars gebruik te word.", "Abasebenzi bangasebenza izinsizakalo ezabelwe. Abaphathi bangasiza ukuphatha ukubhuka nemisebenzi yeqembu kuye ngemvume. Umnikazi kufanele asebenziswe kuphela kubanikazi bezinkampani abathembekile.", "Basebetsi ba ka sebetsa litšebeletso tse abetsoeng. Baokameli ba ka thusa ho laola litheho le mekhoa ea sehlopha ho latela litumello. Mong a lokela ho sebedisoa feela ho beng ba k'hamphani ba tšepetseng.", "Vatirhi va nga tirha tinsita leti nyikiweke. Vakorhisi va nga pfuna ku lawula tibhuku na ntirho wa ntlawa hi ku ya hi mpfumelelo. Mufumi u fanele a tirhisiwa ntsena eka bafumi ba bindzuri laba tshembekaka."],
    ["We'll notify you once your profile is approved and visible to customers. In the meantime, use the time to complete your profile — a strong profile gets approved faster.", "Ons sal jou in kennis stel sodra jou profiel goedgekeur is en sigbaar is vir kliënte. Intussen, gebruik die tyd om jou profiel te voltooi — 'n sterk profiel word vinniger goedgekeur.", "Sizokwazisa uma iphrofayili yakho isemukelwe futhi ibonakala amakhasimende. Ngaleso sikhathi, sebenzisa isikhathi ukuqedela iphrofayili yakho — iphrofayili eqinile ivunywa ngokushesha.", "Re tla u tsebisa ha profil ea hau e amohetsoe 'me e bonahala ho bareki. Nakong eo, sebelisa nako ho qetella profil ea hau — profil e matla e amohelwa ka potlako.", "Hi ta ku tivisa loko profayili ya wena yi pfumeriwa naswona yi vonakala eka vaxavi. Hi nkarhi lowu, tirhisa nkarhi ku hetisa profayili ya wena — profayili leyi matimba yi pfumeriwa hi ku hatlisa."],
    ["Sign in with the email that received this invite. Use the set-password link from your invitation email, or sign in with email OTP — you do not need an existing password.", "Meld aan met die e-pos wat hierdie uitnodiging ontvang het. Gebruik die stel-wagwoord-skakel uit jou uitnodigings-e-pos, of meld aan met e-pos OTP — jy het nie 'n bestaande wagwoord nodig nie.", "Ngena nge-imeyili ethole lesi simemo. Sebenzisa isixhumanisi sokusetha iphasiwedi kusuka ku-imeyili yesimemo, noma ungene nge-imeyili ye-OTP — awudingi iphasiwedi ekhona.", "Kena ka imeile e amohetseng memo ena. Sebelisa sehokelo sa ho beha password ho tsoa imeileng ea memo, kapa o kene ka email OTP — ha o hloka password e seng e le teng.", "Nghena hi imeyili leyi amukelerile xitimelo lexi. Tirhisa xixaka xo veka password ku suka eka imeyili ya xitimelo, kumbe u nghena hi email OTP — a wu lavi password leyi nga kona."],
    ["No service zones matched your address. Ask your marketplace admin to add zones for your area, or go back and check your location — you need at least one zone to continue.", "Geen diensones het jou adres ooreenstem nie. Vra jou markplek-admin om sones vir jou area by te voeg, of gaan terug en gaan jou ligging na — jy benodig ten minste een sone om voort te gaan.", "Azikho izindawo zesevisi ezihambisana nekheli lakho. Cela umphathi wemakethe engeze izindawo zendawo yakho, noma ubuyele emuva uhlole indawo — udinga okungenani indawo eyodwa ukuze uqhubeke.", "Ha ho libaka tsa litšebeletso tse tsamaellan le aterese ea hau. Kopa molaoli oa mmaraka o kenye libaka bakeng sa sebaka sa hau, kapa kgutlela morao 'me u hlahlobe sebaka — o hloka bonyane sebaka se le seng ho tsoela pele.", "A ku na tindzawu ta nseketelo leti fambelanaka na adirese ya wena. Kombela mulanguti wa makete a engetela tindzawu ta ndhawu ya wena, kumbe tlhelela endzhaku u kambela ndhawu — u lava u nga ri nhlayo yin'we yo ya emahlweni."],
    ["Set how you charge customers for travelling to at-home appointments. Keep the platform default to start earning instantly — you can fine-tune this any time from Settings.", "Stel hoe jy kliënte hef vir reis na tuis-afsprake. Hou die platform-verstek om onmiddellik te begin verdien — jy kan dit enige tyd vanaf Instellings verfyn.", "Setha indlela okhokhela ngayo amakhasimende ukuhamba uye emihlangweni yasekhaya. Gcina okuzenzakalelayo kwephulatifomu ukuze uqale ukuzuza ngokushesha — ungakulungisa noma nini kusuka ku-Settings.", "Beha hore na o lefisa bareki joang bakeng sa ho tsamaya ho ea likopanong tsa lapeng. Boloka default ea sethala ho qala ho fumana hang — o ka e lokisa nako efe kapa efe ho tloha ho Settings.", "Veka ndlela leyi u hakerisaka vaxavi hi yona ku famba ku ya emihlangweni ya le kaya. Tshama u ri na default ya platfomu u sungula ku kuma hi xihatla — u nga yi lulamisa nkarhi wun'wana ku suka eka Settings."],
    ["Tips will be allocated to the staff member who performed the service. Advanced split methods (equal split, custom pool) can be configured per-team in the provider portal.", "Fooie word aan die personeellid wat die diens uitgevoer het, toegeken. Gevorderde verdelingmetodes (gelyke verdeling, pasgemaakte pool) kan per span in die verskafferportaal opgestel word.", "Amathiphu azokwabiwa kumsebenzi owenze insizakalo. Izindlela zokuhlukanisa ezithuthukile (ukuhlukanisa okulinganayo, ichibi elenziwe ngokwezifiso) zingalungiswa eqenjini ngalinye ku-provider portal.", "Litefiso li tla abelwa setsebi se entse tšebeletso. Mekhoa e tsoetseng pele ea ho arohana (ho arohana ho lekana, letoto le ikhethileng) e ka hlophisoa sehlopheng ka seng portal ea mofani.", "Tip ti ta avanyisiwa eka xirho xa vatirhi lexi endleke nseketelo. Tindlela to antswisiwa ta ku avanyisa (ku avanyisa hi ku ringana, xipachi lexi endleriweke) ti nga lulamisiwa hi ntlawa eka portal ya mu nyiki."],
    ["Ask the customer to pay using this Paystack link. Paystack generates the transaction reference; this sale is not recorded as paid until you allocate the webhooked payment.", "Vra die kliënt om met hierdie Paystack-skakel te betaal. Paystack genereer die transaksiereferensie; hierdie verkoop word nie as betaal aangeteken totdat jy die webhook-betaling toeken nie.", "Cela ikhasimende likhokhe usebenzisa lesi sixhumanisi se-Paystack. I-Paystack ikhiqiza isibalo sokuthengiselana; le ntengiso ayibhalwa njengokukhokhelwe kuze uwabe inkokhelo ye-webhook.", "Kopa moreki a lefe a sebelisa sehokelo sena sa Paystack. Paystack e hlahisa reference ea phetiso; thekiso ena ha e ngoloe e le lefetsoe ho fihlela u aba tefo ea webhook.", "Kombela xixaxani a hlawule a tirhisa xixaka xa Paystack lexi. Paystack yi tumbuluxa nomboro ya ntirhisano; ku xavisa leku a ku tsariwi tanihi leyi hakeriwaka ku fikela u yisa xihakelo xa webhook."],
    ["Full safety and parental controls — including restricted mode, feed visibility, messaging limits, and blocked users — are available after you create an account or sign in.", "Volledige veiligheid en ouerlike kontroles — insluitend beperkte modus, feed-sigbaarheid, boodskaplimiete en geblokkeerde gebruikers — is beskikbaar nadat jy 'n rekening skep of aanmeld.", "Ukuphepha okuphelele nokulawula kwabazali — kufaka imodi evinjelwe, ukubonakala kwefeed, imikhawulo yemilayezo, nabasebenzisi abavinjelwe — kuyatholakala ngemva kokudala i-akhawunti noma ukungena.", "Polokeho e felletseng le taolo ea batswadi — ho kenyelletsa mokhoa o koetsoeng, ho bonahala ha feed, meeli ea melaetsa, le basebelisi ba thibetsoeng — e fumaneha ka mor'a hore u thehe akhaonte kapa u kene.", "Vuhlayiseki byo helela na vulawuri bya vatswadi — ku katsa ndlela leyi yimisiweke, ku vonakala ka feed, swikomo swa mahungu, na vatirhi lava yimisiweke — swi kumeka endzhaku ka ku tumbuluxa akhawunti kumbe ku nghena."],
    ["You can use the Partner app with parental controls enabled by default. Some social features may be restricted, and a parent or guardian can adjust content & safety settings.", "Jy kan die Partner-app gebruik met ouerlike kontroles by verstek aan. Sommige sosiale funksies kan beperk word, en 'n ouer of voog kan inhoud- en veiligheidinstellings aanpas.", "Ungasebenzisa i-Partner app nokulawula kwabazali okuvuliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo. Ezinye izici zokuxhumana zingase zivinjelwe, futhi umzali noma umgcini angalungisa izilungiselelo zokuqukethwe nokuphepha.", "O ka sebelisa app ea Partner ka taolo ea batswadi e butsoe ka kamehla. Likarolo tse ling tsa sechaba li ka thibeloa, 'me motswadi kapa molebedi a ka fetola litlhophiso tsa dikahare le polokeho.", "U nga tirhisa Partner app hi vulawuri bya vatswadi lebyi pfulekeke hi ku tlula. Swifunghwa swin'wana swa vanhu swi nga yimisiwa, naswona mufumakadzi kumbe mulanguti a nga lulamisa swiyimiso swa leswi nga endzeni na vuhlayiseki."],
    ["Pick the plan that fits today. Free activates instantly — paid plans take you to a secure card payment after you submit. You can upgrade or downgrade any time from settings.", "Kies die plan wat vandag pas. Gratis aktiveer onmiddellik — betaalde planne neem jou na 'n veilige kaartbetaling nadat jy indien. Jy kan enige tyd vanaf instellings opgradeer of afgradeer.", "Khetha uhlelo olufanele namuhla. Okumahhala kuqala ngokushesha — izinhlelo ezikhokhelwayo zikuthumela ekukhokheni okuphephile ngemva kokuthumela. Ungathuthukisa noma wehle noma nini kusuka kuzimiso.", "Khetha moralo o loketseng kajeno. Mahala o qala hang — moralo o lefuoang o u isa tefong e sireletsehileng ea karete ka mor'a hore u kenye. O ka atolosa kapa theoha nako efe kapa efe ho tloha ho litlhophiso.", "Hlawula xileriso lexi fambelanaka namuntlha. Mahala yi sungula hi xihatla — swileriso leswi hakeriwaka swi ku rhumela eka xihakelo xa khadi lexi sirhelelekeke endzhaku ka ku rhumela. U nga antswisa kumbe u tlakusa nkarhi wun'wana ku suka eka swiyimiso."],
    ["You're verifying your own identity as the owner or representative. If your salon is a registered business, your payout account can be in the business name — that's expected.", "Jy verifieer jou eie identiteit as die eienaar of verteenwoordiger. As jou salon 'n geregistreerde besigheid is, kan jou uitbetalingrekening in die besigheidsnaam wees — dit word verwag.", "Uqinisekisa ubuwena njengomnikazi noma ummeleli. Uma isitolo sakho siyinkampani ebhalisiwe, i-akhawunti yakho yokukhokhelwa ingase ibe negama lebhizinisi — lokho kulindelekile.", "O netefatsa boitsebiso ba hau jo bo mong kapa moemeli. Haeba salon ea hau e le k'hamphani e ngolisitsoeng, akhaonte ea hau ea ho lefa e ka ba lebitso la k'hamphani — seo se lebelletsoe.", "U tiyisisa vutivi bya wena tanihi mufumi kumbe muimeleli. Loko salon ya wena yi bindzuri leyi tsarisiweke, akhawunti ya wena yo hakerisa yi nga va na vito ra bindzuri — sweswo swi langeleriwile."],
    ["Sponsored listings are not available in your market yet. When ads are available, you will be able to boost your profile and track visibility, reach, clicks, and bookings here.", "Geborgde listings is nog nie in jou mark beskikbaar nie. Wanneer advertensies beskikbaar is, sal jy jou profiel kan versterk en sigbaarheid, bereik, kliks en besprekings hier kan volg.", "Ukubekwa okuxhasiwe akukatholakali emakethe yakho okwamanje. Lapho izikhangiso zitholakala, uzokwazi ukukhulisa iphrofayili yakho nokulandelela ukubonakala, ukufinyelela, ukuchofoza, nokubhuka lapha.", "Lintho tse hoxiwang ha li fumanehe mmarakeng oa hau hajoale. Ha lipapatso li fumaneha, o tla khona ho matlafatsa profil ea hau le ho latela ho bonahala, ho fihlella, ho tobetsa, le litheho mona.", "Swivulwa leswi hoxiwaka a swi kumeki eka makete wa wena sweswi. Loko swipapati swi kumeka, u ta kota ku tlakusa profayili ya wena na ku landelela ku vonakala, ku fika, ku tlika, na tibhuku laha."],
    ["Start the backend (e.g. pnpm dev in apps/web). Set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL in .env.local (e.g. http://localhost:3000 for emulator, or your machine IP for a device). Then tap Retry.", "Begin die backend (bv. pnpm dev in apps/web). Stel EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL in .env.local (bv. http://localhost:3000 vir emuleerder, of jou masjien-IP vir 'n toestel). Tik dan Herprobeer.", "Qala i-backend (isb. pnpm dev ku-apps/web). Setha i-EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL ku-.env.local (isb. http://localhost:3000 ku-emulator, noma i-IP yomshini wakho wedivayisi). Bese uthepha Retry.", "Qala backend (mohl. pnpm dev apps/web). Beha EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL .env.local (mohl. http://localhost:3000 bakeng sa emulator, kapa IP ea mochini bakeng sa sesebelisoa). Ebe o tlanya Retry.", "Sungula backend (swiv. pnpm dev eka apps/web). Veka EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL eka .env.local (swiv. http://localhost:3000 eka emulator, kumbe IP ya muchini wa wena eka xitirhisiwa). U tlhe u tlika Retry."],
    ["These come from each service's resource links in your catalogue. The schedule checks capacity when you continue; assignments show on the booking and can be edited after saving.", "Hierdie kom van elke diens se hulpbron-skakels in jou katalogus. Die skedule gaan kapasiteit na wanneer jy voortgaan; toewysings wys op die bespreking en kan na stoor gewysig word.", "Lokhu kuvela ezixhumanisini zezinsiza zohlelo lwakho. Isheduli ihlola umthamo lapho uqhubeka; ukuabelwa kuboniswa ekubhukeni futhi kungahlelwa ngemva kokulondoloza.", "Tsena li tsoa lihokelong tsa lisebelisoa tsa tšebeletso e 'ngoe le e 'ngoe katalong ea hau. Mananeo o hlahloba bokhoni ha o tsoela pele; ho abela ho bonahala odareng 'me ho ka fetoloa ka mor'a ho boloka.", "Leswi swi huma eka swixaka swa switirhisiwa swa nseketelo yin'wana na yin'wana eka khatalogu ya wena. Xileriso xi kambela vukulu loko u ya emahlweni; ku nyika swi kombisiwa eka odara naswona swi nga lulamisiwa endzhaku ka ku hlayisa."],
    ["Existing Beautonomi customer. Their platform profile stays customer-managed, but you can still message them, book appointments, sell products, and manage provider notes and tags.", "Bestaande Beautonomi-kliënt. Hul platformprofiel bly kliëntbestuur, maar jy kan steeds vir hulle boodskappe stuur, afsprake bespreek, produkte verkoop en verskaffer-notas en -etikette bestuur.", "Ikhasimende elikhona le-Beautonomi. Iphrofayili yabo yephulatifomu ihlala iphethwe ikhasimende, kodwa usengaxhumana nabo, ubhukela ama-aphoyintment, uthengisa imikhiqizo, futhi uphathe amanothi namathegi omhlinzeki.", "Moreki ea Beautonomi ea seng a le teng. Profil ea bona ea sethala e lula e laoloa ke moreki, empa o ntse o ka romella melaetsa, beha likopano, rekisa lihlahisoa, le ho laola lintlha le li-tag tsa mofani.", "Xixaxani xa Beautonomi lexi nga kona. Profayili ya vona ya platfomu yi tshama yi lawuriwa hi xixaxani, kambe u nga ha rhumela mahungu, endla miha, xavisa swilo, naswona u lawula swiviko na tithegi ta mu nyiki."],
    ["This will sign you out everywhere — phone, tablet, browsers — and require you to log in again on each device. Use this if you suspect someone else may have accessed your account.", "Dit sal jou oral afmeld — foon, tablet, blaaiers — en vereis dat jy weer op elke toestel aanmeld. Gebruik dit as jy vermoed iemand anders het dalk toegang tot jou rekening gekry.", "Lokhu kuzokuphuma kuyo yonke indawo — ifoni, ithebulethi, ama-browser — futhi kuzodinga uphinde ungene kudivayisi ngayinye. Sebenzisa lokhu uma usola ukuthi omunye angase afinyelele i-akhawunti yakho.", "Sena se tla u ntša hohle — fono, thebulete, libatli — 'me se tla hloka hore u kene hape sesebelisoa ka seng. Sebelisa sena haeba u belaela hore motho e mong a ka kena akhaonteng ea hau.", "Lexi xi ta ku humesa laha u nga ri kona — riqingho, thebulete, ti-browser — naswona xi ta lava u nghena nakambe eka xitirhisiwa xin'wana na xin'wana. Tirhisa lexi loko u ehleketa munhu un'wana a nga kona a fikelela akhawunti ya wena."],
    ["Repeating schedules create visits automatically when due (daily job). Set them up from the calendar or this screen. Payment is still per booking unless the client pays separately.", "Herhalende skedules skep besoeke outomaties wanneer dit verskuldig is (daaglikse taak). Stel dit op vanaf die kalender of hierdie skerm. Betaling is steeds per bespreking tensy die kliënt apart betaal.", "Amasheduli aphindayo adala ukuvakasha ngokuzenzakalelayo lapho kufanele (umsebenzi wansuku zonke). Wawaseke kusuka kukhalenda noma lesi sikrini. Inkokhelo isenconywa ngebhuking ngaphandle uma ikhasimende likhokha ngokwehlukile.", "Mananeo a phetaang a theha liketelo ka boiketsetso ha li lokela (mosebetsi oa letsatsi le letsatsi). Li behe ho tsoa khalendareng kapa skrineng ena. Tefo e ntse e le ka odara ntle le haeba moreki a lefa ka thoko.", "Swileriso swo phindza swi tumbuluxa tinyiko hi ku tisungulela loko swi fanele (ntirho wa siku rin'wana). Swi vekiwa ku suka eka kalenda kumbe xikirini lexi. Ku hakela ku ha ku endliwa hi odara handle ka loko xixaxani xi hakerisa hi ndlela yin'we."],
    ["This will end every active session across all your phones, tablets and browsers. You'll need to log in again everywhere. Use this if you suspect someone else accessed your account.", "Dit sal elke aktiewe sessie op al jou fone, tablette en blaaiers beëindig. Jy sal oral weer moet aanmeld. Gebruik dit as jy vermoed iemand anders het jou rekening betree.", "Lokhu kuzophelisa zonke izikhathi ezisebenzayo kuwo wonke amafoni, amathebulethi, namabhrowser. Uzodinga ungene futhi yonke indawo. Sebenzisa lokhu uma usola ukuthi omunye ufikelele i-akhawunti yakho.", "Sena se tla felisa seboka se sebetsang sesebelisoa ka seng, lithebulete le libatli tsa hau. O tla hloka ho kena hape hohle. Sebelisa sena haeba u belaela hore motho e mong a kentse akhaonte ea hau.", "Lexi xi ta heta xiyimo xo hinkwawo xo tirha eka tifoni, tithebulete na ti-browser ta wena. U ta lava u nghena nakambe laha u nga ri kona. Tirhisa lexi loko u ehleketa munhu un'wana a fikelele akhawunti ya wena."],
    ["I understand and accept the cancellation policy and any fees shown above. I acknowledge that eligible refunds are credited to my Beautonomi wallet, not the original payment method.", "Ek verstaan en aanvaar die kansellasiebeleid en enige gelde hierbo gewys. Ek erken dat kwalifiserende terugbetalings na my Beautonomi-beursie gekrediteer word, nie die oorspronklike betalingsmetode nie.", "Ngiyaqonda futhi ngiyamukela inqubomgomo yokukhansela nayo yonke imali ebonisiwe ngenhla. Ngiyavuma ukuthi imbuyiselo efanele ifakwa esikhwameni sami se-Beautonomi, hhayi indlela yokukhokha yokuqala.", "Ke utloisisa 'me ke amohela leano la ho hlakola le litefiso tse bontšitsoeng ka holimo. Ke ananela hore ho busetsa ho loketseng ho kenngoa sepacheng sa ka sa Beautonomi, eseng mokhoa oa pele oa ho lefa.", "Ndzi twisisa naswona ndzi pfumela pholisi ya ku khansela na mali hinkwayo leyi kombisiweke henhla. Ndzi pfumela leswaku ku vuyiswa loku faneleke ku nghenisiwa eka xipache xa mina xa Beautonomi, ku nga ri ndlela yo sungula yo hakela."],
    ["Sign in with the email that received this invite ({{email}}). Use the set-password link from your invitation email, or sign in with email OTP — you do not need an existing password.", "Meld aan met die e-pos wat hierdie uitnodiging ontvang het ({{email}}). Gebruik die stel-wagwoord-skakel uit jou uitnodigings-e-pos, of meld aan met e-pos OTP — jy het nie 'n bestaande wagwoord nodig nie.", "Ngena nge-imeyili ethole lesi simemo ({{email}}). Sebenzisa isixhumanisi sokusetha iphasiwedi kusuka ku-imeyili yesimemo, noma ungene nge-imeyili ye-OTP — awudingi iphasiwedi ekhona.", "Kena ka imeile e amohetseng memo ena ({{email}}). Sebelisa sehokelo sa ho beha password ho tsoa imeileng ea memo, kapa o kene ka email OTP — ha o hloka password e seng e le teng.", "Nghena hi imeyili leyi amukelerile xitimelo lexi ({{email}}). Tirhisa xixaka xo veka password ku suka eka imeyili ya xitimelo, kumbe u nghena hi email OTP — a wu lavi password leyi nga kona."],
    ["Yearly summaries appear here. Until a file is generated, the row stays unavailable; when the API provides a URL, Download opens it (signed URLs and relative API paths are supported).", "Jaarlikse opsommings verskyn hier. Tot 'n lêer gegenereer word, bly die ry onbeskikbaar; wanneer die API 'n URL verskaf, maak Aflaai dit oop (getekende URL's en relatiewe API-pade word ondersteun).", "Izifinyezo zonyaka zivelela lapha. Kuze kufakwe ifayela, umugqa uhlala ungatholakali; lapho i-API inikeza i-URL, i-Download iyivula (ama-URL asayiniwe nezindlela ze-API ezihambisanayo asekela).", "Kakaretso ea selemo e hlaha mona. Ho fihlela faele e hlahisoa, mola o lula o sa fumanehe; ha API e fana ka URL, Download e e bula (li-URL tse saentsoeng le mekhahlelo ea API e tšehetsa).", "Swifinyezo swa lembe swi humelela laha. Ku fikela faele yi tumbuluxiwa, layini yi tshama a yi kumeki; loko API yi nyika URL, Download yi pfula (ti-URL leti sayiniweke na ti path ta API ti sekeriwa)."],
    ["We'll email the code straight to {{recipient}} after payment, with simple steps to redeem it. If they already have a Beautonomi account, it also appears in their wallet automatically.", "Ons e-pos die kode direk na {{recipient}} na betaling, met eenvoudige stappe om dit te verlos. As hulle reeds 'n Beautonomi-rekening het, verskyn dit ook outomaties in hul beursie.", "Sizothumela ikhodi ngqo ku-{{recipient}} ngemva kokukhokha, nezinyathelo ezilula zokuyihlenga. Uma sebenayo i-akhawunti ye-Beautonomi, ivelela nesikhwameni ngokuzenzakalelayo.", "Re tla romella khoutu ka ho toba ho {{recipient}} ka mor'a tefo, ka mehato e bonolo ea ho e sebedisa. Haeba ba se ba na akhaonte ea Beautonomi, e hlaha sepacheng ka boiketsetso.", "Hi ta rhumela khoutu ku {{recipient}} endzhaku ka xihakelo, hi magoza yo olova yo yi hlawula. Loko va se na akhawunti ya Beautonomi, yi humelela eka xipache xa vona hi ku tisungulela."],
    ["Request permanent deletion of your account. When the grace period is enabled, deletion is scheduled for 30 days — your account is locked and you can cancel via the email link or support.", "Versoek permanente verwydering van jou rekening. Wanneer die genadetydperk geaktiveer is, word verwydering vir 30 dae geskeduleer — jou rekening is gesluit en jy kan via die e-pos-skakel of ondersteuning kanselleer.", "Cela ukususwa unaphakade kwe-akhawunti yakho. Uma isikhathi sokubekezelela sivuliwe, ukususwa kuhlelwe izinsuku ezingama-30 — i-akhawunti yakho ivinjiwe futhi ungakhansela ngesixhumanisi se-imeyili noma nokusekelwa.", "Kopa ho tlosoa ha ho sa feleng ha akhaonte ea hau. Ha nako ea ho tshwarela e butsoe, ho tlosoa ho hlophisoa matsatsi a 30 — akhaonte ea hau e koetsoe 'me o ka hlakola ka sehokelo sa imeile kapa tšehetso.", "Kombela ku susiwa hi ku herileke ka akhawunti ya wena. Loko nkarhi wa ku rivalela wu pfuriwile, ku susiwa swi hleleriwile masiku ya 30 — akhawunti ya wena yi pfaleriwe naswona u nga khansela hi xixaka xa imeyili kumbe nseketelo."],
    ["Browse the Learning Centre for guides and common answers. For account or booking-specific help, open a ticket with your details and screenshots where possible. Track replies in My tickets.", "Blaai deur die Leersentrum vir gidse en algemene antwoorde. Vir rekening- of bespreking-spesifieke hulp, maak 'n kaartjie oop met jou besonderhede en skermgrepe waar moontlik. Volg antwoorde in My tickets.", "Dlulisa i-Learning Centre ukuze uthole imihlahlandlela nezimpendulo ezivamile. Ukuze uthole usizo lwe-akhawunti noma lokubhuka, vula itikithi nemininingwane yakho nezithombe zesikrini lapho kungenzeka. Landelela izimpendulo ku-My tickets.", "Sheba Learning Centre bakeng sa litataiso le likarabo tse tloaelehileng. Bakeng sa thuso ea akhaonte kapa odara, bula tekete ka lintlha tsa hau le litšoantšo moo ho khonehang. Latela likarabo ho My tickets.", "Languta Learning Centre ku kuma swiletelo na swihlamulo leswi tolovelekeke. Ku pfuna ka akhawunti kumbe odara, pfula thekete hi vuxokoxoko bya wena na swifaniso loko swi koteka. Landelela swihlamulo eka My tickets."],
  ];
  for (const row of rows) r(...row);
}
